.com/en/article/justin-timberlake-released-a-country-inspired-album-in-2018-long-before-it-became-a-trend/</guid></item><item><title>15 年前的今天，Jay-Z 和 Kanye West 推出了史上最佳合作专辑之一</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/on-this-day-15-years-ago-jay-z-and-kanye-west-dropped-one-of-the-best-collaborative-albums-of-all-time/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;15 年前的今天，Jay-Z 和 Kanye West 凭借《Watch The Throne》制作了可以说是有史以来最伟大的合作专辑。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/on-this-day-15-years-ago-jay-z-and-kanye-west-dropped-one-of-the-best-collaborative-albums-of-all-time/"&gt;15 年前的今天，Jay-Z 和 Kanye West 放弃了史上最佳合作专辑之一的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 15:03:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/on-this-day-15-years-ago-jay-z-and-kanye-west-dropped-one-of-the-best-collaborative-albums-of-all-time/</guid></item><item><title>胡德是谁？关于最新漫威对手角色的一切信息</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/who-is-the-hood-everything-to-know-about-the-newest-marvel-rivals-character/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Marvel Rivals 粉丝可以详细了解 Marvel 传说中的帕克·罗宾斯 (Parker Robbins) 以及先锋队在比赛中带来的技能。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子《 &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/who-is-the-hood-everything-to-know-about-the-newest-marvel-rivals-character/"&gt;谁是胡德？》关于最新 Marvel Rivals 角色的一切知识&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 13:41:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/who-is-the-hood-everything-to-know-about-the-newest-marvel-rivals-character/</guid></item></channel></rss>